description=A Starfleet Type 6 shuttlecraft for single player and multiplayer. Beam up from anywhere, lay in a course at the LCARS helm and set her down on any ground with room for her, or lift her off the ground and fly her from the pilot's seat. Inside is a working compartment: a galley with running water, a berth, a sick bay, and Starfleet lockers holding phasers, a medical set and photon torpedoes. A replicator aft of the galley makes anything the ship has a pattern for, powered by dilithium you go out and find. The sick bay's Emergency Medical Hologram diagnoses, treats, and is the only cure in the mod for a zombie bite. The crew can dress the part: six Starfleet uniforms in three divisions, duty and dress. Shields hold the dead back from a landed shuttle. On servers the crew shares one ship; sandbox options limit it to its owner and crew. It needs three tiles by five of clear ground to land.
author=Ensign Elliot Mousseau
